<title>UK: Merrill Lynch adds 1.5 bln Ffr to bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch adds 1.5 bln Ffr to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole, Paribas and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT  * 2.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    20.JUN.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.99</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    101.99    SPREAD	+43 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BLN FFR ON 21.MAY.96</p>
<p> PAY DATE **21.DEC.96 LISTING    PARIS</p>
<p> NOTES    **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
